  "description": "The first arm of the ordered EVALUATE EIBAID at app/cbl/COADM01C.cbl:93-95. EVALUATE is ordered - the first matching WHEN wins - so DFHENTER must be tried before DFHPF3 and before WHEN OTHER, and this case pins that arm by pressing ENTER with option 2 and observing PROCESS-ENTER-KEY run to the transfer to COUSR01C. The arm is chosen by comparing the raw EIBAID byte, which is what line 93 does; COADM01C does not copy CSSTRPFY, so resolving the byte to a key token first would risk making some other key behave like ENTER in a program that has no such behaviour.",
